#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:186
#, xml-text
msgid "Setting the installation prefix"
msgstr "Configurando o prefixo de instalação"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:188
#, xml-text
msgid "Installing in /opt/qt5"
msgstr "Instalando em /opt/qt5"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:191
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The BLFS editors recommend installing <application>Qt5</application> in a "
"directory other than <filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, ie "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/opt/qt5</filename>.  To do this, set the "
"following environment variable:"
msgstr ""
"Os(As) editores(as) do BLFS recomendam instalar o "
"&quot;<application>Qt5</application>&quot; em um diretório diferente de "
"&quot;<filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>&quot;, ou seja, "
"&quot;<filename class=\"directory\">/opt/qt5</filename>&quot;. Para fazer "
"isso, configure a seguinte variável de ambiente:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:197
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>export QT5PREFIX=/opt/qt5</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>export QT5PREFIX=/opt/qt5</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><tip><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:201
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Sometimes the installation paths are hardcoded into installed files.  This "
"is the reason why <filename class=\"directory\">/opt/qt5</filename> is used "
"as installation prefix instead of <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/opt/qt-&qt5-version;</filename>. To create a versioned "
"<application>Qt5</application> directory, you may create a versioned "
"directory and a symlink:"
msgstr ""
"Ocasionalmente, os caminhos da instalação são rigidamente codificados nos "
"arquivos instalados. Essa é a razão pela qual <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/opt/qt5</filename> é usado como prefixo da instalação "
"em vez de <filename class=\"directory\">/opt/qt-&qt5-version;</filename>. "
"Para criar um diretório versionado do <application>Qt5</application>, você "
"possivelmente crie um diretório versionado e um link simbólico:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><tip><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:209
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir -pv /opt/qt-&qt5-version;\n"
"ln -sfnv qt-&qt5-version; /opt/qt5</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir -pv /opt/qt-&qt5-version;\n"
"ln -sfnv qt-&qt5-version; /opt/qt5</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><tip><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:213
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Later on, you may want to install other versions of "
"<application>Qt5</application>. To do that, just remove the symlink, create "
"the new versioned directory, and recreate the <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/opt/qt5</filename> symlink again before building the "
"new version.  Which version of <application>Qt5</application> you use "
"depends only on where the symlink points."
msgstr ""
"Mais tarde, você possivelmente quera instalar outras versões do "
"<application>Qt5</application>. Para fazer isso, apenas remova o link "
"simbólico, crie o novo diretório versionado e recrie o link simbólico "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/opt/qt5</filename> novamente antes de "
"construir a versão nova. Qual versão do <application>Qt5</application> você "
"usa depende somente de onde o link simbólico aponta."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:225
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <xref linkend=\"qca\"/> has been installed and you are reinstalling or "
"updating this package, then <application>qca</application> will need to be "
"reinstalled."
msgstr ""
"Se <xref linkend=\"qca\"/> tiver sido instalado e você estiver reinstalando "
"ou atualizando esse pacote, então <application>qca</application> precisará "
"ser reinstalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:234
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Qt5"
msgstr "Instalação do Qt5"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><warning><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:238
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <application>Qt5</application> is being reinstalled into the same "
"directory as an existing instance, run the commands done by <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>, such as <command>make "
"install</command>, from a console or non-Qt5 based window manager. It "
"overwrites <application>Qt5</application> libraries that should not be in "
"use during the install process."
msgstr ""
"Se o &quot;<application>Qt5</application>&quot; estiver sendo reinstalado no"
" mesmo diretório de uma instância existente, [então] execute os comandos "
"feitos pelo(a) &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;,"
" como &quot;<command>make install</command>&quot;, a partir de um console ou"
" gerenciador de janelas não baseado em &quot;Qt5&quot;. Eles sobrescrevem "
"bibliotecas do &quot;<application>Qt5</application>&quot; que não deveriam "
"estar em uso durante o processo de instalação."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><caution><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:249
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you did not install some of the recommended dependencies, examine "
"<command>./configure --help</command> output to check how to disable them or"
" use internal versions bundled in the source tarball."
msgstr ""
"Se você não instalou alguma das dependências recomendadas, examine a saída "
"gerada de <command>./configure --help</command> para verificar como "
"desabilitá-las ou usar versões internas incluídas no tarball do fonte."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:257
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The build time and space required for the full "
"<application>Qt5</application> is quite long. The instructions below do not "
"build the tutorials and examples. Removing the "
"<parameter>-nomake</parameter> line will create a complete build."
msgstr ""
"O tempo de construção, e espaço, exigido para o "
"&quot;<application>Qt5</application>&quot; completo é bastante longo. As "
"instruções abaixo não constroem os tutoriais e exemplos. Remover-se a linha "
"<parameter>-nomake</parameter> criará uma construção completa."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:266
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The BLFS editors do not recommend installing <application>Qt5</application> "
"into the <filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename> hierarchy because it "
"becomes difficult to find components and to update to a new version.  If you"
" do want to install <application>Qt5</application> in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, the directories need to be specified "
"explicitly.  In this case, set <envar>QT5PREFIX=/usr</envar> and add the "
"following to the configure arguments below:"
msgstr ""
"Os(As) editores(as) do BLFS não recomendam instalae o "
"<application>Qt5</application> na hierarquia <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename> porque se torna difícil encontrar "
"componentes e atualizar para uma nova versão. Se você realmente desejar "
"instalar o <application>Qt5</application> em <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, os diretórios precisam ser "
"especificados explicitamente. Nesse caso, configure "
"<envar>QT5PREFIX=/usr</envar> e adicione o seguinte aos argumentos de "
"configuração abaixo:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:277
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>            -archdatadir    /usr/lib/qt5                \\\n"
"            -bindir         /usr/bin                    \\\n"
"            -plugindir      /usr/lib/qt5/plugins        \\\n"
"            -importdir      /usr/lib/qt5/imports        \\\n"
"            -headerdir      /usr/include/qt5            \\\n"
"            -datadir        /usr/share/qt5              \\\n"
"            -docdir         /usr/share/doc/qt5          \\\n"
"            -translationdir /usr/share/qt5/translations \\\n"
"            -examplesdir    /usr/share/doc/qt5/examples</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>            -archdatadir    /usr/lib/qt5                 \\\n"
"            -bindir         /usr/bin                    \\\n"
"            -plugindir      /usr/lib/qt5/plugins        \\\n"
"            -importdir      /usr/lib/qt5/imports        \\\n"
"            -headerdir      /usr/include/qt5            \\\n"
"            -datadir        /usr/share/qt5              \\\n"
"            -docdir         /usr/share/doc/qt5          \\\n"
"            -translationdir /usr/share/qt5/translations \\\n"
"            -examplesdir    /usr/share/doc/qt5/examples</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:289
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now apply a patch to pull in the fixes curated by kde for those modules "
"which are required by packages mentioned in this book:"
msgstr ""
"Agora aplique um remendo para obter as correções selecionadas pelo KDE para "
"aqueles módulos que sejam exigidos pelos pacotes mencionados neste livro:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:293
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../qt-everywhere-opensource-"
"src-&qt5-version;-kf5-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../qt-everywhere-opensource-"
"src-&qt5-version;-kf5-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:296
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The patch is supposed to be used in a git repository. Otherwise some files "
"that should be modified by <command>configure</command> after applying the "
"patch are not touched. Fortunately, it is enough to create a <filename "
"class=\"directory\">.git</filename> directory in the <filename "
"class=\"directory\">qmake</filename> directory where the "
"<command>configure</command> script is run:"
msgstr ""
"Presume-se que o remendo seja usado em um repositório git. Caso contrário, "
"alguns arquivos que deveriam ser modificados pelo "
"<command>configure</command> depois de aplicar o remendo não seriam tocados."
" Felizmente, é suficiente criar um diretório <filename "
"class=\"directory\">.git</filename> no diretório <filename "
"class=\"directory\">qmake</filename> onde o conjunto de comandos sequenciais"
" <command>configure</command> for executado:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:304
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"pre\">mkdir -pv qtbase/.git</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"pre\">mkdir -pv qtbase/.git</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:307
#, xml-text
msgid "Fix a security vulnerability in qtbase:"
msgstr "Corrija uma vulnerabilidade de segurança no qtbase:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:310
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../qt-everywhere-opensource-"
"src-&qt5-version;-security_fix-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../qt-everywhere-opensource-"
"src-&qt5-version;-security_fix-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:313
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Qt5</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>Qt5</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:316
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure -prefix $QT5PREFIX                        \\\n"
"            -sysconfdir /etc/xdg                      \\\n"
"            -confirm-license                          \\\n"
"            -opensource                               \\\n"
"            -dbus-linked                              \\\n"
"            -openssl-linked                           \\\n"
"            -system-harfbuzz                          \\\n"
"            -system-sqlite                            \\\n"
"            -nomake examples                          \\\n"
"            -no-rpath                                 \\\n"
"            -syslog                                   \\\n"
"            -skip qtlocation                          \\\n"
"            -skip qtwebengine                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure -prefix $QT5PREFIX                        \\\n"
"            -sysconfdir /etc/xdg                      \\\n"
"            -confirm-license                          \\\n"
"            -opensource                               \\\n"
"            -dbus-linked                              \\\n"
"            -openssl-linked                           \\\n"
"            -system-harfbuzz                          \\\n"
"            -system-sqlite                            \\\n"
"            -nomake examples                          \\\n"
"            -no-rpath                                 \\\n"
"            -syslog                                   \\\n"
"            -skip qtlocation                          \\\n"
"            -skip qtwebengine                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:331
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure -prefix $QT5PREFIX                        \\\n"
"            -sysconfdir /etc/xdg                      \\\n"
"            -confirm-license                          \\\n"
"            -opensource                               \\\n"
"            -dbus-linked                              \\\n"
"            -openssl-linked                           \\\n"
"            -system-harfbuzz                          \\\n"
"            -system-sqlite                            \\\n"
"            -nomake examples                          \\\n"
"            -no-rpath                                 \\\n"
"            -journald                                 \\\n"
"            -skip qtlocation                          \\\n"
"            -skip qtwebengine                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure -prefix $QT5PREFIX                        \\\n"
"            -sysconfdir /etc/xdg                      \\\n"
"            -confirm-license                          \\\n"
"            -opensource                               \\\n"
"            -dbus-linked                              \\\n"
"            -openssl-linked                           \\\n"
"            -system-harfbuzz                          \\\n"
"            -system-sqlite                            \\\n"
"            -nomake examples                          \\\n"
"            -no-rpath                                 \\\n"
"            -journald                                 \\\n"
"            -skip qtlocation                          \\\n"
"            -skip qtwebengine                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:347
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:351
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:354
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:360
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Remove references to the build directory from installed library dependency "
"(prl) files by running the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Remova referências para o diretório de construção dos arquivos de "
"dependência de biblioteca (prl) instalados executando o seguinte comando "
"como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:365
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>find $QT5PREFIX/ -name \\*.prl \\\n"
"   -exec sed -i -e '/^QMAKE_PRL_BUILD_DIR/d' {} \\;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>find $QT5PREFIX/ -name \\*.prl \\\n"
"    -exec sed -i -e '/^QMAKE_PRL_BUILD_DIR/d' {} \\;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:369
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install images and create the menu entries for installed applications.  The "
"<envar>QT5BINDIR</envar> variable is used here to point to the directory for"
" the executable programs.  If you have changed the bindir above, "
"<envar>QT5BINDIR</envar> will need to be adjusted below.  Be sure that the "
"<envar>QT5BINDIR</envar> variable is defined in root's environment and as "
"the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Instale imagens e crie entradas de menu para aplicativos instalados. A "
"variável &quot;<envar>QT5BINDIR</envar>&quot; é usada aqui para apontar para"
" o diretório dos programas executáveis. Se você tiver mudado o "
"&quot;bindir&quot; acima, [então] &quot;<envar>QT5BINDIR</envar>&quot; "
"precisará ser ajustada abaixo. Certifique-se de que a variável "
"&quot;<envar>QT5BINDIR</envar>&quot; esteja definida no ambiente do(a) "
"&quot;root&quot; e como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:378
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>QT5BINDIR=$QT5PREFIX/bin\n"
"\n"
"install -v -dm755 /usr/share/pixmaps/                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -Dm644 qttools/src/assistant/assistant/images/assistant-128.png \\\n"
"                  /usr/share/pixmaps/assistant-qt5.png &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -Dm644 qttools/src/designer/src/designer/images/designer.png \\\n"
"                  /usr/share/pixmaps/designer-qt5.png  &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -Dm644 qttools/src/linguist/linguist/images/icons/linguist-128-32.png \\\n"
"                  /usr/share/pixmaps/linguist-qt5.png  &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -Dm644 qttools/src/qdbus/qdbusviewer/images/qdbusviewer-128.png \\\n"
"                  /usr/share/pixmaps/qdbusviewer-qt5.png &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -dm755 /usr/share/applications &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/assistant-qt5.desktop &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=Qt5 Assistant\n"
"Comment=Shows Qt5 documentation and examples\n"
"Exec=$QT5BINDIR/assistant\n"
"Icon=assistant-qt5.png\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Categories=Qt;Development;Documentation;</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/designer-qt5.desktop &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=Qt5 Designer\n"
"GenericName=Interface Designer\n"
"Comment=Design GUIs for Qt5 applications\n"
"Exec=$QT5BINDIR/designer\n"
"Icon=designer-qt5.png\n"
"MimeType=application/x-designer;\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Categories=Qt;Development;</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/linguist-qt5.desktop &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=Qt5 Linguist\n"
"Comment=Add translations to Qt5 applications\n"
"Exec=$QT5BINDIR/linguist\n"
"Icon=linguist-qt5.png\n"
"MimeType=text/vnd.trolltech.linguist;application/x-linguist;\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Categories=Qt;Development;</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/qdbusviewer-qt5.desktop &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=Qt5 QDbusViewer\n"
"GenericName=D-Bus Debugger\n"
"Comment=Debug D-Bus applications\n"
"Exec=$QT5BINDIR/qdbusviewer\n"
"Icon=qdbusviewer-qt5.png\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Categories=Qt;Development;Debugger;</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>QT5BINDIR=$QT5PREFIX/bin\n"
"\n"
"install -v -dm755 /usr/share/pixmaps/                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -Dm644 qttools/src/assistant/assistant/images/assistant-128.png \\\n"
"                  /usr/share/pixmaps/assistant-qt5.png &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -Dm644 qttools/src/designer/src/designer/images/designer.png \\\n"
"                  /usr/share/pixmaps/designer-qt5.png  &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -Dm644 qttools/src/linguist/linguist/images/icons/linguist-128-32.png \\\n"
"                  /usr/share/pixmaps/linguist-qt5.png  &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -Dm644 qttools/src/qdbus/qdbusviewer/images/qdbusviewer-128.png \\\n"
"                  /usr/share/pixmaps/qdbusviewer-qt5.png &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -dm755 /usr/share/applications &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/assistant-qt5.desktop &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=Qt5 Assistant\n"
"Comment=Mostra documentação e exemplos do Qt5\n"
"Exec=$QT5BINDIR/assistant\n"
"Icon=assistant-qt5.png\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Categories=Qt;Development;Documentation;</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/designer-qt5.desktop &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=Qt5 Designer\n"
"GenericName=Interface Designer\n"
"Comment=Projetar GUIs para aplicativos do Qt5\n"
"Exec=$QT5BINDIR/designer\n"
"Icon=designer-qt5.png\n"
"MimeType=application/x-designer;\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Categories=Qt;Development;</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/linguist-qt5.desktop &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=Qt5 Linguist\n"
"Comment=Adicionar traduções a aplicativos do Qt5\n"
"Exec=$QT5BINDIR/linguist\n"
"Icon=linguist-qt5.png\n"
"MimeType=text/vnd.trolltech.linguist;application/x-linguist;\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Categories=Qt;Development;</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/qdbusviewer-qt5.desktop &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=Qt5 QDbusViewer\n"
"GenericName=D-Bus Debugger\n"
"Comment=Depurar aplicativos do D-Bus\n"
"Exec=$QT5BINDIR/qdbusviewer\n"
"Icon=qdbusviewer-qt5.png\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Categories=Qt;Development;Debugger;</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:449
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Some packages such as <xref linkend='vlc'/> look for certain executables "
"with a -qt5 suffix.  Run the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user to create the necessary symlinks:"
msgstr ""
"Alguns pacotes, como o &quot;<xref linkend='vlc'/>&quot;, procuram por "
"certos executáveis com um sufixo &quot;-qt5&quot;. Execute o seguinte "
"comando como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot; para criar os links simbólicos "
"necessários:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:455
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>for file in moc uic rcc qmake lconvert lrelease lupdate; do\n"
"  ln -sfvn $QT5BINDIR/$file /usr/bin/$file-qt5\n"
"done</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>for file in moc uic rcc qmake lconvert lrelease lupdate; do\n"
"  ln -sfvn $QT5BINDIR/$file /usr/bin/$file-qt5\n"
"done</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:462
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:465
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-confirm-license</parameter>: Accept license without prompting "
"user during configuration."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-confirm-license</parameter>: Aceita a licença sem avisar o(a) "
"usuário(a) durante a configuração."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:470
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-opensource</parameter>: Install the opensource version of "
"<application>Qt</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-opensource</parameter>: Instale a versão de fonte aberto do "
"&quot;<application>Qt</application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:475
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-nomake examples</parameter>: This switch disables building of "
"the example programs included in the source tarball. Remove it if you want "
"to build them."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-nomake examples</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita a construção "
"dos programas de exemplo incluídos no tarball do fonte. Remova-a se quiser "
"construí-los."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:482
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-system-sqlite</parameter>: This switch enables use of the system"
" version of <application>SQLite</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-system-sqlite</parameter>: Essa chave habilita uso da versão do "
"sistema do <application>SQLite</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:487
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-dbus-linked</parameter> <parameter>-openssl-linked</parameter>: "
"These switches enable explicit linking of the "
"<application>D-Bus</application> and <application>OpenSSL</application> "
"libraries into <application>Qt5</application> libraries instead of "
"<command>dlopen()</command>-ing them."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-dbus-linked</parameter><parameter>-openssl-linked</parameter>: "
"Essas chaves habilitam a vinculação explícita das bibliotecas do "
"<application>D-Bus</application> e do <application>OpenSSL</application> no "
"<application>Qt5</application> em vez de abri-las via "
"<command>dlopen()</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:497
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-syslog</parameter>: This switch allows to send Qt messages to "
"the <command>syslog</command> logging system."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-syslog</parameter>: Essa chave permite enviar mensagens Qt para "
"o sistema de registro <command>syslog</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:502
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-journald</parameter>: This switch allows to send Qt messages to "
"the <command>journald</command> logging system."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-journald</parameter>: Essa chave permite enviar mensagens Qt "
"para o sistema de registro <command>journald</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:507
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-skip qtlocation</parameter>: This switch disables building the "
"Qt5 location module.  Some dependencies of this module are shipped in the "
"tarball but the copies are outdated, so these dependencies won't build with "
"<xref linkend='gcc'/> and <xref linkend='icu'/>.  Nothing in BLFS needs this"
" module."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-skip qtlocation</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita construir o "
"módulo de local do Qt5. Algumas dependências desse módulo são enviadas no "
"tarball, mas as cópias estão desatualizadas, de forma que essas dependências"
" não serão construídas com <xref linkend='gcc'/> e <xref linkend='icu'/>. "
"Nada no BLFS precisa desse módulo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:515
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-skip qtwebengine</parameter>: This switch disables building the "
"QtWebEngine.  BLFS only supports <xref linkend=\"qtwebengine\"/> from Qt6."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-skip qtwebengine</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita construir o "
"QtWebEngine. O BLFS suporte somente <xref linkend=\"qtwebengine\"/> oriundo "
"do Qt6."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:521
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-system-harfbuzz</parameter>: This switch enables use of the "
"system version of <application>Harfbuzz</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-system-harfbuzz</parameter>: Essa chave habilita o uso da versão"
" do sistema do <application>Harfbuzz</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:528
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring Qt5"
msgstr "Configurando o Qt5"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:531
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:534
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <xref linkend=\"sudo\"/> is installed, QT5DIR should be available to the "
"super user as well. Execute the following commands as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se o &quot;<xref linkend=\"sudo\"/>&quot; estiver instalado, [então] "
"&quot;QT5DIR&quot; também deveria estar disponível para o(a) "
"superusuário(a). Execute os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:539
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/sudoers.d/qt &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>Defaults env_keep += QT5DIR</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/sudoers.d/qt &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>Defaults env_keep += QT5DIR</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:543
#, xml-text
msgid "If you installed Qt5 in /usr"
msgstr "Se você instalou o &quot;Qt5&quot; em &quot;/usr&quot;"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:546
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you installed <application>Qt5</application> in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, create an environment variable needed "
"by certain packages.  As the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você instalou o &quot;<application>Qt5</application>&quot; em "
"&quot;<filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>&quot;, [então] crie uma "
"variável de ambiente necessária para certos pacotes. Como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:552
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh\n"
"\n"
"QT5DIR=/usr\n"
"export QT5DIR\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh</literal>\n"
