#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:564
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you installed <application>Qt5</application> in a location other than "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, you need to update the "
"following configuration files so that <application>Qt5</application> is "
"correctly found by other packages and system processes."
msgstr ""
"Se instalou o &quot;<application>Qt5</application>&quot; em um local "
"diferente de &quot;<filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>&quot;, "
"[então] você necessita atualizar os seguintes arquivos de configuração, de "
"forma que o &quot;<application>Qt5</application>&quot; seja encontrado "
"corretamente por outros pacotes e processos do sistema."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:571
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"As the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user, update the "
"<filename>/etc/ld.so.conf</filename> file and the dynamic linker's run-time "
"cache file:"
msgstr ""
"Como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;, atualize o arquivo "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/ld.so.conf</filename>&quot; e o arquivo de "
"&quot;cache&quot; de tempo de execução do vinculador dinâmico:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:576
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/ld.so.conf &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal># Begin Qt addition\n"
"\n"
"/opt/qt5/lib\n"
"\n"
"# End Qt addition</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"ldconfig</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/ld.so.conf &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal># Inicia adição do Qt\n"
"\n"
"/opt/qt5/lib\n"
"\n"
"# Termina adição do Qt</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"ldconfig</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:587
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/ld.so.conf"
msgstr "/etc/ld.so.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:591
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"As the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user, create the "
"<filename>/etc/profile.d/qt5.sh</filename> file:"
msgstr ""
"Como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>, crie "
"o arquivo <filename>/etc/profile.d/qt5.sh</filename>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5.xml:595
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh\n"
"\n"
"QT5DIR=/opt/qt5\n"
"\n"
"pathappend $QT5DIR/bin           PATH\n"
"pathappend $QT5DIR/lib/pkgconfig PKG_CONFIG_PATH\n"
"\n"
"export QT5DIR\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Inicia /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh\n"
"\n"
"QT5DIR=/opt/qt5\n"
"\n"
"pathappend $QT5DIR/bin           PATH\n"
"pathappend $QT5DIR/lib/pkgconfig PKG_CONFIG_PATH\n"
"\n"
"export QT5DIR\n"
"\n"
"# Termina /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

